        option.LAVA_TILE_SIZE = Lava Pattern Scale
        option.LAVA_TILE_SIZE.comment = Controls the repeating grid scale of the lava noise texture.\n\n§e[Visual] §fAdjusts the scale of molten crust patterns across lava lakes.\n§a[Performance: None] §fUV coordinate scalar.

